-- 4.A CROSS-APP FOREIGN KEYS — REAL constraints, not soft UUIDs.
--
--     Orders sits DOWNSTREAM of bizapps-common and bizapps-accounting in the
--     BizApps install order, so those schemas and tables already exist when
--     this migration runs. Referential integrity across apps is therefore
--     enforced by the database, not by convention:
--
--       __mj_BizAppsCommon      → Person / Organization / Address  (the party +
--                                 location model every app shares)
--       __mj_BizAppsAccounting  → JournalEntry (per-line/payment/rev-rec ledger
--                                 lineage) and Dimension / DimensionValue
--                                 (analytic tagging carried from the line)
--
--     INSTALL-ORDER DEPENDENCY: bizapps-common and bizapps-accounting MUST be
--     installed before bizapps-orders or this section fails. This is intended —
--     the failure is the dependency check.
-- =============================================================================

